@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：Kafka 某分区失败时不越过其他分区

participant KafkaConsumerWorker as Worker
participant CoreListener
participant KafkaConsumer

note over Worker
一次 poll 返回：
P0: offset 10, 11
P1: offset 20, 21
end note

Worker -> CoreListener: P0 offset 10
CoreListener --> Worker: RETRY
Worker -> KafkaConsumer: seek(P0, 10)
Worker -> Worker: break P0 loop

Worker -> CoreListener: P1 offset 20
CoreListener --> Worker: SUCCESS
Worker -> KafkaConsumer: commit(P1, 21)
Worker -> CoreListener: P1 offset 21
CoreListener --> Worker: SUCCESS
Worker -> KafkaConsumer: commit(P1, 22)

note over Worker,KafkaConsumer
P0 不推进，下一轮仍从 10 开始；
P1 已处理记录正常推进，不会因为 P0 失败被静默丢弃。
end note
@enduml
